# The ambience's key (docs/HARNESS.md, "Ambient sound"): the soundtrack analysis, the root following
# the playing track, and the glide to the next track's tonic through the gap between them.
# Offline a track never ends by itself, so `audio music end` ends it; the gap then counts down at
# the harness's frame time (wait settle: 0.5 s per frame).
audio tonality wait
audio music state
audio tonality
set audio.music_gap_s 20
audio music end
wait settle 4; audio tonality gap_early
wait settle 16; audio tonality gap_mid
wait settle 12; audio tonality gap_late
wait settle 12; audio music state
wait settle 8; audio tonality next_track
